  "details": "I have many issues with EAC implimentation and many others have expressed the concerns I have already and perhaps better than I could but an overlooked issue is the rendering of many mods that add accessibility to VR Chat that is absent from the base game such as speach to text mods that allow the Deaf and hard of hearing to read what others say on sceen or mods that help people with colorblindness and the like. VR Chat will alienate a significant portion of their playerbase due to this fact alone without the following inclusion of compensation in the form of direct implimentation of much neededaccessibility options.",
